  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges (peel if preferred).\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e18f603fa63dcbb0186/step-2ec8cc00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Finely chop cucumber and tomato.\n• Roughly chop rocket leaves.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber and tomato. Add a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Season to taste with salt and pepper and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e18f603fa63dcbb0186/step-4a2c4c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Melt the butter in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water and bring to the boil. Add couscous and the stock powder.\n• Stir to combine, cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e18f603fa63dcbb0186/step-c4430020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir rocket through couscous and divide between bowls.\n• Top with cucumber salsa and Moroccan pumpkin.\n• Crumble fetta over the top and serve with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e18f603fa63dcbb0186/step-f8c9a230.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
